  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Au Chien Chic is located at 107 rue Blaise Pascal, in the Mourillon district of Toulon. The salon presents itself (PagesJaunes, listing updated by the professional) as a place offering baths, hair removal, clipping and scissor cuts for dogs and cats; a customer describes one groomer as using natural products. It also sells accessories: ready-to-wear clothing for dogs, leashes, collars, harnesses, cushions, carrier crates, shampoos and perfumes.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The salon's Facebook page gives 107 rue Blaise Pascal, the phone number 04 83 42 67 44 and opening Monday to Saturday from 9am to 5pm, which PagesJaunes confirms. On chien.com, the salon states that it accepts all breeds and all sizes of dogs. No prices are published: call for a quote according to your dog's breed and coat. PagesJaunes indicates payment by cheque or cash.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: use the visit to the salon to pick up a new leash or harness if needed — everything is sold on site.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Mourillon district and its beach are right next door, a good option for a walk before or after grooming.</p>
